{"parse": {"title": "Curses", "pageid": 1749, "revid": 25572, "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/9/9a/Cursed_Finger.png/revision/latest?cb=20250323070916\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"&quot;Ah! I knew it! Light is best appreciated in the flesh!&quot;\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/9/9a/Cursed_Finger.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20250323070916\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"193\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Cursed Finger.png\" data-image-key=\"Cursed_Finger.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Cursed_Finger.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\"><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"color: #6500b3;\"><i>\"Ah! I knew it! Light is best appreciated in the flesh!</i>\"</span></p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"THIS_PAGE_HAS_BEEN_MOVED\">THIS PAGE HAS BEEN MOVED</span></h2>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"free\" href=\"https://animeadventures.fandom.com/wiki/Powerups\">https://animeadventures.fandom.com/wiki/Powerups</a>\n</p><p><b>Curses</b>, added in <i><a href=\"/wiki/Update_Log#Update_6.5_-_Jujutsu_Kaisen_Update_Part_2\" title=\"Update Log\">Update 6.5</a></i>, are a way to increase the stats of any unit at the cost of another stat. Are you willing to sacrifice something?\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Requirement\">Requirement</span></h2>\n<p>To curse a unit, you need at least one <span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span class=\"material-tooltip\" data-param=\"Cursed Finger\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Cursed Finger\"><img alt=\"Cursed Finger\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/9/9a/Cursed_Finger.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/22?cb=20250323070916\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"22\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Cursed Finger.png\" data-image-key=\"Cursed_Finger.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></span></span> <span class=\"dottedText\"><a href=\"/wiki/Items#Materials\" title=\"Items\">Cursed Finger</a></span></span><br /></span> which can be obtained from the <b><a href=\"/wiki/Dungeons#Cursed_Womb\" title=\"Dungeons\">Cursed Womb</a></b> dungeon. To enter the <b><a href=\"/wiki/Dungeons#Cursed_Womb\" title=\"Dungeons\">Cursed Womb</a></b> dungeon, you need a Cursed Womb key which can be dropped from secret enemies that spawn in <b>Cursed Academy Infinite</b>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_curse_units\">Where to curse units</span></h2>\n<p>After you've received your first Cursed Finger, click/tap on it in your <b>Items Or Go To Your Area</b> and you'll be brought to <i>Sukuno's</i> (<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://jujutsu-kaisen.fandom.com/wiki/Sukuna\">Sukuna</a>)domain\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Cursing_units\">Cursing units</span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"font-family: rubik,helvetica,arial,sans-serif; text-align: center;\">Gain (1 At Random)\n</th>\n<th style=\"font-family: rubik,helvetica,arial,sans-serif; text-align: center;\">Lose (1 At Random)\n</th>\n</tr></tbody><caption>\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr><td><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/e/e2/Damage_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20220824022130\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Damage icon\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/e/e2/Damage_icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20220824022130\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Damage icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Damage_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span>\n2.5% - 11%\n\n</p>\n</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/e/e2/Damage_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20220824022130\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Damage icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Damage icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Damage_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/e/e2/Damage_icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20220824022130\" /></a></span>\n2.5% - 11%\n\n</p>\n</span></td>\n</tr></tbody><caption>\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr><td><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/1/13/Range_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20220824022151\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Range icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Range icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Range_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/1/13/Range_icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20220824022151\" /></a></span>\n2.5% - 11%\n\n</p>\n</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/1/13/Range_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20220824022151\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Range icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Range icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Range_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/1/13/Range_icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20220824022151\" /></a></span>\n2.5% - 11%\n\n</p>\n</span></td>\n</tr></tbody><caption>\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr><td><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/8/84/SPA_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20220824022220\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"SPA icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"SPA icon.png\" data-image-key=\"SPA_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/8/84/SPA_icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20220824022220\" /></a></span>\n2.5% - 11%\n\n</p>\n</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/8/84/SPA_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20220824022220\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"SPA icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"SPA icon.png\" data-image-key=\"SPA_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"h